<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_scalar__reciprocal_8hpp">glm/ext/scalar_reciprocal.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Define secant, cosecant and cotangent functions.</para>
</section>
